		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 3 · 2 Actions · Reach 1.</strong></p><p><strong>Damage:</strong> 4d6+10. Regain HP equal to the damage dealt. If this bloodies a creature or damages a Bloodied creature, you can have them make a WIL save. On a fail, they are Charmed by you for 1 hour. On a save, they are immune to being Charmed by this spell for 24 hours.</p>",
			"higherLevelEffect": "",
			"upcastEffect": "<p><strong>Upcast:</strong> +5 damage. If 7+ mana is spent, you can attempt to rewrite the Charmed creature's memories of the past 30 days. The more inconsistent the memories, the more likely they will fail to stick.</p>"
